    print nothing, as they did at baseline in STEP 1.
  - `show running-config interface port1.0.10` is back to its three baseline lines.  Both
    `rmon collection` lines are gone.
  - `show running-config | include rmon` leaves only `snmp-server enable trap rmon`, which is
    this case's own setup line and is removed at teardown.
  - Over SNMP: `snmpq walk 1.3.6.1.2.1.16` -> `No Such Object available on this agent at this
    OID` (NOSUCH), with `snmpq get sysName.0` -> `STRING: awplus` (VALUE) as the control in the
